{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content -Raw .rsi/TASK.json'","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"taskId\": \"tf-0294-a02\",\n  \"sourceTaskId\": \"TF-0294\",\n  \"title\": \"Re-verify A2 multi-agent orchestration controlled pilot gate\",\n  \"baseCommit\": \"4e942fbce0a2dbcb3437a1cef6de651e6cff9508\",\n  \"objective\": \"A02 按原 spec 门限复验 A2 Multi-Agent Orchestration 受控 pilot 门；逐条映射 4 个判据到当前可执行证据，不重定义门限；修正 spec 里两个不存在的路径引用并补入覆盖判据1/预算的计数器测试；判据4（多 worker resume 新会话）无专用测试，如实记为 NO-GO residual。\",\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n    \"判据1 deferral agreement ≥ 90% + disagreement>10% → degrade_to_live_only：deprecation-counters 单测断言（数值门限未改）。\",\n    \"判据2 started wave 不可 re-plan：resource-aware-wave-scheduler 单测（\\\"ignores rePlan when appliesToWave is already started\\\" 等）。\",\n    \"判据3 p99 ≤ 80ms：performance-budgets 断言。\",\n    \"判据4 多 worker resume 创建新会话：当前树无专用测试 → 如实记 NO-GO residual，不伪装通过。\",\n    \"修正 spec drift：移除树中不存在的 cross-area-composition.test.ts 与 cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts 引用，补入计数器测试，并加 coverage 守卫。\",\n    \"干净候选定向测试、类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\"\n  ],\n  \"targetScope\": [\n    \"harness/specs/tasks/a2-multi-agent-orchestration-pilot.md\",\n    \"tests/unit/a02-a2-gate-coverage.test.ts\",\n    \"harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a02-orchestration-pilot-reverify.md\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a02-a2-orchestration-gate.md\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a02-acceptance.json\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A02-SHA256SUMS\"\n  ],\n  \"arm\": \"treatment\",\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the task in this repository. Do not inspect or modify tests in the final hidden oracle. Do not install dependencies, use network, create loops/retries, or modify product locks. Report exact checks you actually ran.\"\n}\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-ChildItem -Force | Select-Object Mode,Name | Format-Table -AutoSize'","aggregated_output":"\r\nMode  Name\r\n----  ----\r\nd---- .agents\r\nd---- .github\r\nd---- .rsi\r\nd---- artifacts\r\nd---- docs\r\nd---- electron\r\nd---- harness\r\nd---- openclaw_runtime\r\nd---- packages\r\nd---- patches\r\nd---- plans\r\nd---- public\r\nd---- reports\r\nd---- resources\r\nd---- scripts\r\nd---- shared\r\nd---- src\r\nd---- team\r\nd---- tests\r\n-a--- .env.example\r\n-a--- .gitattributes\r\n-a--- .gitignore\r\n-a--- .mcp.json\r\n-a--- .npmrc\r\n-a--- .prettierrc\r\n-a--- AGENTS.md\r\n-a--- clawx-extensions.json\r\n-a--- CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\r\n-a--- components.json\r\n-a--- electron-builder.yml\r\n-a--- entitlements.mac.plist\r\n-a--- eslint.config.mjs\r\n-a--- index.html\r\n-a--- LICENSE\r\n-a--- package.json\r\n-a--- playwright.config.ts\r\n-a--- pnpm-lock.yaml\r\n-a--- pnpm-workspace.yaml\r\n-a--- postcss.config.js\r\n-a--- README.ja-JP.md\r\n-a--- README.md\r\n-a--- README.ru-RU.md\r\n-a--- README.zh-CN.md\r\n-a--- SECURITY.md\r\n-a--- skills-lock.json\r\n-a--- tailwind.config.js\r\n-a--- tsconfig.json\r\n-a--- tsconfig.node.json\r\n-a--- tsconfig.test.json\r\n-a--- tsconfig.web.json\r\n-a--- vite.config.ts\r\n-a--- vitest.agent-dev.node.config.ts\r\n-a--- vitest.config.ts\r\n-a--- vitest.runtime-effectiveness.config.ts\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
